# Commit Workflow

Commit changes at key junctions during work, and **especially once a plan is completed**.

## When to Commit

- After finishing execution of a plan or multi-step task
- After completing a logical unit of work (e.g., a feature, a refactor, a batch of fixes)
- Before switching context to a different task
